  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">European Union Global Access and Trade Expertise (EU GATE) Cambodia</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">&lt;p class=&quot;ql-align-justify&quot;&gt;The &lt;strong&gt;Outcome&lt;/strong&gt; of &lt;strong&gt;European Union Global Access and Trade Expertise (EU GATE) &lt;/strong&gt;is to &lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(13, 13, 13);&quot;&gt;improve regulations, measures and practices in Cambodia in support of inclusive and sustainable exports to the EU and regional markets&lt;/span&gt;. This Outcome objective includes a strong focus on &lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(13, 13, 13);&quot;&gt;environmentally sustainable and socially inclusive trade &lt;/span&gt;with the EU and the region. The Outcome focuses on four main targets:&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;ql-align-justify&quot;&gt;&#xb7;The Royal Government of Cambodia (RGC) negotiates &lt;span style=&quot;color: black;&quot;&gt;agreements, understandings, or undertakings with key trading partners in the process of Least Developed Country (LDC) graduation, that promote the EU approach to environmentally sustainable and socially inclusive trade.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;ql-align-justify&quot;&gt;&#xb7;RGC develops and adopts key reforms that strengthen the business environment &lt;u&gt;and&lt;/u&gt; protect consumers, support a deepening of the digitalization of its economy, and embrace inclusive and sustainable trade in a manner that &lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(13, 13, 13);&quot;&gt;promotes the external dimension of EU internal policies or EU interests.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;ql-align-justify&quot;&gt;&#xb7;The average time of import/export processing from arrival to physical release (combined for all border crossing points and for all modes: sea, air, and road) decreases, thereby improving the cost competitiveness of all exporters and importers operating in Cambodia.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;-SMEs supported by the project, including women-led SMEs, develop export readiness and increase their exports to EU and/or ASEAN markets by 30% from their baseline&lt;/p&gt;</narrative>
  </description>
